abstract: >-
  Pure-C++17/20, gfx906 HIP, and Tenstorrent Blackhole P150A TT-Metalium heterogeneous
  inference engine and FP64 RAREBAL-LDLQ WHT128-HLUT4 (4.125 bpw) weight quantization suite
  for baidu/ERNIE-5.5-Flash-Preview (300B = 43L backbone + 3L MoE DSpark+SA, 1,048,576 context)
  on the 7-accelerator SB-M5-P2-192G workstation (5x AMD Radeon Instinct MI50 128 GiB HBM2 with
  4/5 MI50s — all 4/4 TP4/VHA/1M KV ranks and all 3/3 32 GiB cards — at 16.0 GT/s PCIe x16 and
  card4 16 GiB MoE-only worker + Wayland renderD131 on Switchbox #2 Slot #0 at 8.0 GT/s PCIe x16,
  42.77 GB/s ALL-5 H2D + 2x Tenstorrent Blackhole P150A 64 GiB GDDR6 with kBatchSlots=256 +
  253.7 MiB on-die Tensix L1 SRAM over 4x 800G FABRIC_1D, AMD EPYC 7542 host, 0 B CPU DDR4 spill,
  100% lossless BF16 1M HCA+MLA KV cache, 512-slot DDR4 + Dual-NVMe O_DIRECT .kvblk snapshots,
  sub-2 ms ChatPrefixCache JSON delta, M-fused HCA split-K, and zero-VRAM 8/6-gram DSpark+SA).
